The primary conflict arises from the need to validate user input (regex and directory) while ensuring that the application remains flexible and user-friendly. For instance, strict validation of the regex may limit valid patterns, and enforcing directory restrictions may complicate user experience if not handled transparently. Additionally, the requirement to read file contents safely may introduce performance overhead.

